      "registrationStatus": "open",
      "description": "# 🚀 Hacknauts 2.0\n\n### 🌌 Beyond the Known, Begins the Extraordinary\n\n**Hacknauts 2.0 (HKN-26)** is a 24-hour hackathon at **Guru Nanak Dev Engineering College, Ludhiana**, organized by the **Causmic Club**. 🚀\n\nAfter a successful first mission, we're back in orbit. 🛰️ This year, everything revolves around one idea: **a black hole pulling streams of code into itself. 🕳️**\n\nThe brightest builders, designers, and problem-solvers converge for one weekend - to ideate, build, and ship something that didn't exist before. 💻✨\n\n**One mission. One singularity. Your code, pulled toward something bigger. 🌠**\n\n---\n\n### 🌌 What Awaits You\n\n* ⏱️ **24 hours** of building, mentorship, and midnight debugging\n* 🛰️ **Multiple mission tracks** — revealed soon\n* 🍕 **Free food, beverages, and high-speed internet** for all participants\n* 🎁 **Swag and goodies** in every participant kit\n* 🏅 **Certificates for every team + prizes** across tracks\n* 🏆 **Best Freshers Team** — a special award for the best-performing team consisting of first-year students\n* 👩‍🚀 **Best Girls Team** — a special award for the best-performing all-girls team\n* 🤝 **A crew of like-minded builders** — and recruiters watching the launch pad\n\n---\n\n### 📍 Event Info\n\n* 📅 **Date:** November 14–15, 2026\n* 🏫 **Venue:** Guru Nanak Dev Engineering College, Gill Park, Ludhiana — 141006\n* 👥 **Team Size:** 2–4 members\n* 🧑‍💻 **Mode:** In-person\n* 🪐 **Mission Code:** HKN-26 — every transmission carries it\n\n---\n\n### 📝 Registrations\n\n* 🚀 **Process:** Apply right here on Devfolio\n\n* 💬 **Join the WhatsApp & Discord for updates**\n\n**[WhatsApp](https://chat.whatsapp.com/EDvb3mBBEZQKKEBKEZCijD)**\n\n**[Discord](https://discord.gg/fBpkNWM7d)**\n\n---\n\n### 📊 PPT Submission\n\nAll participating teams are required to submit their **project presentation (PPT)** before the deadline.\n\n🎨 **[PPT Template](https://canva.link/btilhjpotmmporm)**\n\n📤 **[Submit Your PPT](https://tally.so/r/pb2Xo1)**\n\n⏰ **Submission Deadline:** **30 October 2026**\n\nMake sure your presentation follows the provided template and is submitted before the deadline. 🚀\n\n---\n\n### 🌠 Your Mission Awaits\n\nBuild boldly. Think beyond the obvious. Solve something that matters.\n\n**The singularity is waiting. What will you pull into orbit? 🕳️🚀**\n\n**Hacknauts 2.0 - Beyond the Known, Begins the Extraordinary.**",
