      "registrationStatus": "open",
      "description": "⚡ Hack on Hills 8.0\n\nThe Age of Autonomous Agents\n\nWelcome to Hack on Hills 8.0, the flagship 48-hour hackathon hosted by the App Team, NIT Hamirpur.\n\nOver the years, Hack on Hills has grown into one of North India's largest student-run hackathons, bringing together thousands of developers, designers, innovators, and technology enthusiasts from across the country.\n\nThis edition explores a defining shift in technology: the rise of autonomous agents.\n\nAs AI systems evolve from tools that generate content to systems that can reason, plan, and execute tasks, we stand at the beginning of a new computing paradigm. Hack on Hills 8.0 invites participants to build products, platforms, and experiences that leverage this transformation to solve real-world problems.\n\nWhether you're building intelligent agents, decentralized applications, sustainable technology solutions, or entirely new ideas, this is your opportunity to turn ambitious concepts into working products.\n\n---\n\n💡 Tracks\n\n🤖 AI & Autonomous Agents\n\nBuild systems capable of reasoning, planning, decision-making, and autonomous execution.\n\n⛓️ Blockchain & Web3\n\nDevelop decentralized applications, protocols, and infrastructure for the next generation of the internet.\n\n🌱 Sustainability & Social Impact\n\nCreate technology solutions addressing environmental, social, and community challenges.\n\n🚀 Open Innovation\n\nExplore bold ideas beyond predefined categories and build solutions that create meaningful impact.\n\n---\n\n⚙️ Format & Eligibility\n\nTeam Size: 2-4 Members\n\nShortlisting: Based on participant profiles and application review\n\nFinals: 48-hour in-person hackathon at NIT Hamirpur\n\nParticipants will collaborate, prototype, and present their projects before a panel of industry experts, mentors, and judges.\n\n---\n\n🏆 Prizes & Sponsor Tracks\n\nHack on Hills 8.0 features a prize pool, sponsor challenges, and ecosystem bounties designed to recognize outstanding innovation across multiple domains.\n\nPrize details and partner tracks will be announced soon.\n\n---\n\n🔥 Why Hack on Hills?\n\n- 48 hours of building, learning, and collaboration\n- Mentorship from industry professionals and developer communities\n- Networking opportunities with talented builders from across the country\n- Exciting sponsor tracks, workshops, and challenges\n- A platform to transform ideas into impactful solutions\n\nWith over 1,500+ registrations across previous editions, Hack on Hills continues to foster a community of builders who are passionate about technology, innovation, and problem-solving.\n\n---\n\n📍 Venue: NIT Hamirpur\n\n📅 Dates: [Dates to be announced]\n\nBuild for the Age of Autonomous Agents.\n\nJoin us for 48 hours of innovation, collaboration, and creation at Hack on Hills 8.0.",
