      "description": "## About Hackman X\n\nTen years ago, Hackman began at DSCE, bringing students together to build, experiment, and turn their ideas into projects. Today, it stands as the oldest hackathon at DSCE and one of the oldest student hackathons in Bengaluru. Now, as we return for our **10th edition**, we're excited to celebrate a decade of Hackman with all of you!\n\nOrganised by **GENESIS**, the student club of the Department of Information Science & Engineering at Dayananda Sagar College of Engineering, Hackman X is a **24-hour offline hackathon** happening at the DSCE campus.\n\nGot an idea you've been waiting to work on? Want to try something you've never built before? Or just want to spend 24 hours coding, figuring things out with your team, and turning an idea into something real? This is your chance!\n\n\n## What's in it for you? 👀\n\n- **Cash prizes and more!** Compete for cash prizes and exciting rewards from our sponsors.\n- **Render credits:** All attendees can claim $50 in Render building credits through a dedicated link we'll share during the hackathon.\n- **A domain of your own:** Every member of the teams selected for the final offline round will receive a .xyz domain.\n- **Mentorship:** Get guidance from mentors and industry professionals as you work on your project.\n- **New connections:** Meet fellow builders, exchange ideas, and find people who are just as excited about tech as you are.\n\nAnd of course, you get to be part of **Hackman's 10th edition**, a milestone we're genuinely excited to celebrate!\n\n## Ready to join us?\n\nGet your team together, start thinking about what you want to build, and send in your application. We can't wait to see what you come up with!",
