      "description": "**CODEARAMBH 2.0 👻**\n\n**Where Ideas Come Alive.**\n\n**CODEARAMBH 2.0** is a **24-hour offline hackathon** organized by **TechFusion — the Official Technical & Coding Club of CSE, Hi-Tech Institute of Engineering & Technology (HIET), Ghaziabad**.\n\nBring your ideas to life, collaborate with fellow innovators, and build a working **prototype/MVP** that solves real-world problems.\n\n**🚀 Tracks**\n* 🚚 **Transportation & Logistics**\n* 🎓 **Education Technology (EdTech)**\n* 🩺 **Healthcare & Wellness**\n* 🌱 **Agriculture & Sustainability**\n* ✈️ **Travel & Smart Tourism**\n* 💡 **Open Innovation**\n\n**⚠️ MANDATORY PPT SUBMISSION**\n\n**PPT submission on the official CODEARAMBH 2.0 portal is MANDATORY for every participating team.**\n\nAfter completing your Devfolio registration, you **must submit your PPT through the CODEARAMBH 2.0 Main Portal** using the provided template.\n\n🔴 **IMPORTANT:** If your team **does not submit the PPT on the official CODEARAMBH 2.0 Main Portal within the specified deadline, your team will NOT be considered or qualified for the next round.**\n\n**Devfolio registration alone does NOT complete the application process.**\n\n**📌 Required Links**\n\n* 📝 **PPT Submission / Main Portal:** https://code-arambh.netlify.app/register\n* 📊 **Official PPT Template:** https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1z2cLwrnjljIVhjI1o3lgjOTEXlBXv9Cy/\n* 💬 **Official WhatsApp Group:** https://chat.whatsapp.com/KPFgZftsTp08XuaqnEmdGv\n\n**Please make sure your PPT follows the official template and is submitted successfully on the main portal before the deadline.**\n**🎯 What to Expect**\n\n* 24 hours of building, coding, and innovation\n* Hands-on problem solving and collaboration\n* Prototype/MVP development\n* Mentorship and technical guidance\n* Judging by industry and technical experts\n* Exciting prizes, certificates, goodies, and recognition\n\n**👨‍💻 Who Can Participate?**\n\nDevelopers, designers, students, innovators, and tech enthusiasts are welcome to participate and turn their ideas into impactful solutions.\n\nWhether you're an experienced hacker or participating in your first hackathon, **CODEARAMBH 2.0** is your opportunity to build something meaningful.\n\n**🎃 Build. Innovate. Collaborate. Create.**\n\n**Come with an idea. Leave with an innovation.**\n\n**Organized by:** TechFusion, HIET Ghaziabad\n**Mode:** Offline\n**Duration:** 24 Hours\n**Venue:** Hi-Tech Institute of Engineering & Technology, Ghaziabad\n\n**📧 Contact & Important Links**\n\n**Official Email:** [hackathonhiet@gmail.com](url)\n**TechFusion Email:** [techfusion@hietgroup.org](url)\n\n**💼 LinkedIn:** [https://www.linkedin.com/company/hiet-techfusion/](url)\n**📸 Instagram:** [https://instagram.com/hiet.techfusion](url)\n\nFor registration, technical, submission, or event-related queries, participants can contact the organizing team through the official email addresses above.",
