      "description": "Indo Global Colleges presents **Srijan Setu**. It is a **24-hour hackathon** by **Google Developer Groups on Campus: Indo Global College**, built around one simple idea — **turning ideas into meaningful solutions.**\n\nInspired by the spirit of **Spider-Man**, Srijan Setu is about using your skills, creativity, and technology with purpose. Just as every thread becomes stronger when it connects to another, great solutions are built when **people, ideas, and technology come together.**\n\n# **Build. Connect. Create.**\nBring your team of **2–4 members**, choose a challenge from our innovation tracks, and spend 24 hours turning your idea into a working solution.\n\nWhether you're a developer, designer, problem-solver, or someone with an idea worth building, **Srijan Setu is your space to experiment, collaborate, learn, and create.**\n\n\n# **🧩 Innovation Tracks**\n\nExplore challenges across:\n**• HealthTech\n• EdTech\n• AgriTech\n• E-Commerce\n• Open Theme**\n\nYou can choose the domain that interests you and build a solution that addresses a meaningful problem.\n\n# **Why Srijan Setu?**\n\nThis isn't just about writing code for 24 hours.\n\nIt's about **finding problems worth solving, building with purpose, learning from others, and connecting your ideas to real-world impact.**\n\nExpect an environment where you can:\n\n•💡 Turn ideas into working solutions\n•🤝 Collaborate with people from different backgrounds\n•🧠 Learn through hands-on building\n•🛠️ Experiment with modern technologies\n•🌐 Connect with fellow builders and the developer community\n•🎯 Take your solution from concept to prototype\n\nUse AI as a tool to think, build, experiment, and accelerate your development.\n\nYour solution should still reflect your team's understanding, creativity, and contribution.\n\n# **🕷️ Your Web Starts Here**\n\nEvery great solution begins with a connection — between a problem and an idea, an idea and technology, and technology and people.\n\n**Srijan Setu is where those connections begin.**\n\nFor all future updates and communication, Join here: https://chat.whatsapp.com/EO6Wmn2rdVIBa5uh2IevYP",
