      "registrationStatus": "closed",
      "description": "**Innohacks 4.0** is the flagship national-level 24-hour hackathon organized by **Innogeeks**, the technical club of KIET Deemed to be University, Delhi-NCR, Ghaziabad. After three successful editions, Innohacks 4.0 is back to bring together developers, designers, innovators, and problem-solvers from across India.\n\nWith 4 exciting themes, Innohacks 4.0 is a platform to transform ideas into impactful technological solutions.\n\nWhether you're building your first prototype or bringing years of technical experience to the table, this is your chance to **learn, collaborate, build, and showcase** what you can create.\n\n# Hackathon Structure:\n\n## 1. Idea PPT Submission Round\n\n**2nd September 2026 to 3rd October 2026**\n\nThe journey begins with your idea. Submit a PPT outlining your **problem statement, proposed solution, technology stack, and implementation approach**.\n\n**Submit here:**\n[**Round 1 Submission**](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe4VURd5rEZwdL-23-nLRYUMEcbvI4WNiBNBJVKqvMLZ7rT1w/viewform?usp=publish-editor)\n\n**Follow this template for PPT submission:**\n[**PPT Template**](https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/15T9x0WYNaC1Qi6BirwIXckRCytc08Waep0fc1YFMOYg/edit?usp=sharing)\n\n> **Note:** Simply registering on Devfolio does **not** guarantee shortlisting. To be eligible for consideration, teams **must submit their Idea PPT and GitHub team details by 3rd October, 2026**.\n\n## 2. Offline Hackathon\n\n**For 200 Hackers — 10th & 11th October 2026**\n\nThe top 50-100 teams will be shortlisted for the final **24-hour offline hackathon** at KIET Deemed to be University, where you'll turn your ideas into working prototypes, collaborate with your team, and present your solution to the judges.\n\n# Mark your calendars for **October 10th and 11th, 2026!**\n\nGet your team ready, bring your ideas, and prepare for **24 hours of building, learning, and innovation.**\n\n**Join the [**Innohacks Discord Server**](https://discord.gg/yPX8vGzMmH) as a mandatory step!**\n\n*Whether you're a **blockchain enthusiast**, an **AI aficionado**, or a **fintech wizard**, Innohacks 4.0 has something for everyone! From **AR/VR marvels** to **AIoT wonders**, get ready to push the boundaries of what's possible! ⚡*\n\n# Visit our website for more details:\n\n[**Innohacks 4.0**](https://www.innohacks.live/) 🪐",
