      "description": "HackBIOS 2k26 is a national-level hackathon bringing together the brightest young innovators, developers, and tech enthusiasts from across the country to solve real-world problems through technology.\n\n*Our previous edition saw 350+ attendees come together for an incredible offline experience ,  a remarkable success that left a lasting impression on all who attended.*\n\n**This year, HackBIOS 2k26 will be conducted in two rounds:**\n\nRound 1 — Online Selection\n\n - Submit a PPT based on your idea/solution\n- Choose from the following tracks: Healthcare, Web3/Blockchain, Web Development, Cybersecurity, AI/ML, FinTech, EdTech, and Open Innovation\n- 📄 Only the provided PPT template will be accepted — submissions in any other format will not be considered\n- 📄 ppt link - [https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xagMiVaa8v-QAU_-ByFGgzw45WfrpBKP/view?usp=drivesdk](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xagMiVaa8v-QAU_-ByFGgzw45WfrpBKP/view?usp=drivesdk)\n\nRound 2 — Offline Hackathon (24 Hrs)\n\n- Shortlisted teams build & present a working prototype onsite \n\n**📁 A detailed guide and demo video are available to help you prepare — [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1sz2XH2rJgvy8TrmQ468ALh2hkZBq9b9s?usp=sharing](https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1sz2XH2rJgvy8TrmQ468ALh2hkZBq9b9s?usp=sharing)**\n\n Why HackBIOS?\n*More than a competition, HackBIOS is a hub of innovation, collaboration, and talent development  encouraging young minds to explore technology, engage with the latest innovations, and connect with vibrant tech communities.*\n\n**Website link -** [https://www.hackbios.xyz/](https://www.hackbios.xyz/)\n📢 **Join our Discord:** [https://discord.com/invite/kDpNBsU3qt](https://discord.com/invite/kDpNBsU3qt)\n**Follow the HackBIOS 2K26 channel on WhatsApp:** [https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbC7IecJENxtS3ob6G0v](https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbC7IecJENxtS3ob6G0v)",
