      "description": "**Hack4Brahma**: Northeast India’s Biggest Hackathon Returns\n\nDrawing inspiration from the mighty Brahmaputra River - the lifeline uniting the Seven Sisters and One Brother - Hack4Brahma is rooted in unity, resilience, and innovation. Season 2 amps up the stakes with a military theme, paying tribute to the Assam Rifles, guardians of peace in India's strategically vital Northeast.\n\nThis region, connected to the mainland via the narrow 20-km Siliguri Corridor (aka Chicken’s Neck) and bordering Bangladesh and Myanmar, demands cutting-edge solutions amid unique geopolitical challenges.\n\nAfter Season 1's roaring success - 4,600+ registrations from across India, sparking a tech movement in just 24 hours - we're back bigger and bolder. What started as a spark to rival Delhi, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, and Chennai's ecosystems now aims to put Guwahati, Shillong, and Imphal on the map.\n\nJoin **Hack4Brahma** for world-class hackathon vibes, empowering local talent to showcase Northeast India's unstoppable potential.",
