      "registrationStatus": "closed",
      "description": "# Builders Day\n\nBuilders Day by [HackUnion](https://hackunion.in) is the culmination of the [OpenBuild Week](https://hackunion.in/obw) journey, a space where builders come together to collaborate, solve problems, build products, and compete.\n\nFrom learning to building.\nFrom ideas to prototypes.\nFrom campus communities to one Builders Day.\n\n**This is where builders come to build.**\n\n## Before You Join\n\nBuilders Day is not about starting your project from scratch on the final day.\n\nProjects can be developed from **28 July to 26 September**, with the final submission deadline at **3:00 PM IST on 26 September**.\n\nWhether you're bringing an MVP from the OBW Campus Series or building independently, come prepared with a working product. We recommend having your project **~95% complete before Builders Day**.\n\nUse the final day to **improve, test, scale, polish, network, showcase your work, and celebrate what you've built.**\n\nYour project will be evaluated on:\n\n* **Accessibility**\n* **Working Product**\n* **Purpose & Scalability**\n* **Pitching**\n\n### Read the Hackathon Guide Before You Start\n\nWe've put together the **Builders Day Participant Guide** with everything you need to know — eligibility, project requirements, development timeline, judging criteria, submissions, AI and tool usage, team participation, prizes, final-day expectations, and the submission checklist.\n\n**📖 Read the complete Hackathon Guide → [HACKATHON GUIDE LINK](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1E94z4u54nHiUxBpw96l-DLpnb-3EEDcx/view?usp=sharing)**\n\n**Read it. Prepare your project. Then come ready to build.**\n\n## Builders Day\n\n**26 September 2026**\n\n**Build it. Ship it. Show what it can become.**",
