      "description": "🚀 About GlitchFiesta\n\nWelcome to GlitchFiesta, where bugs turn into breakthroughs and problems turn into prototypes.\n\nDriven by our motto, Code the Chaos, \nGlitch fiesta brings together ambitious student developers, designers, and innovators under one roof to build real-world solutions through high-intensity sprints.\n\nWhether you're building your first web app or integrating advanced machine learning pipelines, this is your playground to experiment, collaborate, learn, and build fearlessly.\n\n🔥 Why Participate?\n\n* Build Meaningful Projects: Turn your ideas into functional prototypes and real-world solutions.\n* Network & Collaborate: Connect with student developers, mentors, creators, and community members.\n* Prizes & Recognition: Compete for applicable track prizes, sponsor bounties, recognition, certificates, and exclusive perks, subject to the availability and eligibility of each reward.\n* Workshops & Guidance: Get feedback and guidance on design, code architecture, development, and pitching.\n\n🛠 Tracks & Themes\n\nGlitchFiesta is open to projects across domains, with special focus areas including:\n\n* AI & Machine Learning\n* Web3 & Blockchain\n* HealthTech & Social Impact\n* FinTech & Open Innovation\n\n👥 Eligibility\n\n* Open to college students, developers, and tech enthusiasts.\n* Team Size: 2 to 4 members.\n* Solo participants may also participate and can form a team before the hacking phase begins.\n\n📜 Rewards & Recognition\n\nRewards may include applicable cash prizes, track-specific awards, sponsor bounties, certificates, merchandise, goodies, and other recognition.\n\nPrize and bounty availability may vary depending on the applicable track, sponsor participation, eligibility criteria, and final event structure.\n\nGear up, grab your team, and get ready to turn chaos into code!",
