      "registrationStatus": "open",
      "description": "# **CodeStorm 2026: FutureForge**\n\n## **Build the Future. Shape the Impossible.**\n\nCodeStorm 2026: FutureForge is a student-focused innovation hackathon where developers, designers, creators, and problem-solvers come together to build impactful solutions using technology.\n\nUnlike traditional hackathons that focus on a single domain, FutureForge embraces **Open Innovation**, allowing participants to tackle real-world challenges across any field they are passionate about. Whether it's Artificial Intelligence, Web Development, Cybersecurity, Education Technology, Sustainability, Productivity Tools, Mobile Applications, or something entirely unique, this is your platform to innovate.\n\nThis hackathon is part of the **CodeStorm 2026 Series**, an initiative dedicated to empowering students through hands-on learning, collaboration, and innovation.\n\nThe event will be conducted completely online through our Discord community. Participation is free, and teams may consist of **1–6 members**.\n\nParticipants are encouraged to think boldly, experiment fearlessly, and build projects that create meaningful impact while showcasing technical excellence and creativity.\n\n## **What Can You Build?**\n\nParticipants are encouraged to develop:\n\n* Artificial Intelligence solutions\n* Web applications and platforms\n* Mobile applications\n* Cybersecurity tools\n* Productivity and automation software\n* Educational technology solutions\n* Sustainability and social impact projects\n* Games and interactive experiences\n* Open-source projects\n* Any innovative idea that solves a real-world problem\n\n## **Why Participate?**\n\n* Build real-world projects\n* Learn and apply emerging technologies\n* Collaborate with talented students\n* Showcase your skills to a wider audience\n* Receive certificates and recognition\n* Win exciting rewards and prizes\n* Join a growing community of innovators\n\n## **Guidelines**\n\n* Follow the Code of Conduct.\n* Team size: **1–6 members**.\n* Projects must be developed during the hackathon period.\n* Open-source libraries, frameworks, and APIs may be used.\n* Submissions must include a working prototype, demo, or showcase.\n* Participants must submit all required materials before the deadline.\n\n## **Important Links**\n\n### Join Our Official Discord Server\n\nhttps://discord.com/invite/a3mE9SMCqb\n\n### Follow Us On Instagram\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/code_storm_hackathon/\n\n### Official Website\n\nhttps://code-storm-hackathon.pages.dev\n\n## **Community**\n\nCodeStorm is a student-led initiative dedicated to creating opportunities for young innovators, builders, and creators across India.\n\n### **Team CodeStorm ⚡**\n\n**Empowering India's Next Generation of Innovators**\n\n# Join Our Discord Server For Official Announcements, Results, Winner Updates, and Certificate Distribution\n\nhttps://discord.com/invite/a3mE9SMCqb",
