      "description": "EAG Global Buildathon\n\nJuly 20, 2026 to October 1, 2026 · Online\n\nThe Ethereum Application Guild Online Hackathon brings together developers, designers, researchers, and builders to create the next generation of Ethereum applications and open-source infrastructure.\n\nParticipants will explore **six key tracks**:\n\n**1. AI x Ethereum & Agent Economy**\n\n**2. Local AI, Private AI & User-Owned Data**\n\n**3. Smart Devices, Open Hardware & Privacy Hardware**\n\n**4. Application Middleware & Open-Source Tooling**\n\n**5. AI-Native Creator Economy & Digital Rights**\n\n**6. Real-World Ethereum Applications**\n\n\nFrom autonomous agent payments and privacy-first AI to open hardware, developer tooling, stablecoins, and public goods, the hackathon encourages projects that solve real problems and can grow beyond the event.\n\nBuild for real users. Create open infrastructure. Grow beyond the hackathon.",
