      "description": "Already building something relevant to this hackathon? Post what you are working on, tag **PravaPayments** on X and the team may fast-track strong applications.\n\nCalling all curious cats and code kittens  Meowathon 2025 is here!\nThis is not your average hackathon. It's 24 hours of chaotic creativity, bad puns, great code, and even better memes. Whether you're building a productivity app for lazy cats or an AI that meows when your code breaks, there's space for all your wildest ideas.\n\nExpect:\n\nCat-themed challenges 🐱\n\nPun-derful prizes 🎁\n\nMeme wars, midnight karaoke, and more 🎤\n\nA whole community that purrs together\n\nSo sharpen those claws (and skills), grab your squad, and let's make tech fun again.\nCome for the code, stay for the chaos.",
