      "description": "<p><strong>Mergetober: Open Source Month with Cognee | WeMakeDevs x Hacker's Unity</strong></p>\n<p>Mergetober is a month-long open source contribution event hosted by WeMakeDevs in collaboration with Cognee. The goal is simple: get paid to contribute to real-world open source software that ships to developers and enterprises worldwide!</p>\n<p><strong>Event Overview</strong></p>\n<p>Instead of building a hackathon project that gets archived and forgotten, participants build production-ready integrations for Cognee&mdash;the open-source memory layer for AI agents. Every contribution merges directly into the real product codebase used by developers globally.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Duration: October 1 to October 31</li>\n<li>Format: 100% Online &amp; Solo (Individual contributions)</li>\n<li>Cost: Free to participate</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What is Cognee?</strong></p>\n<p>AI models start fresh with zero context on every call. Cognee is an open-source memory layer that ingests documents, chats, code, and data, turning them into an interconnected knowledge graph so AI agents can reliably remember and reason across sessions.</p>\n<p><strong>The Challenge: Build Integrations</strong></p>\n<p>You can contribute in two ways:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Path A (Pick an Existing Issue): Choose an open issue labeled <code>INTEGRATIONS</code> and <code>hackathon</code> on the Cognee GitHub repository (e.g., GitLab, Linear, Elasticsearch, Postman, AWS S3, ClickUp).</li>\n<li>Path B (Propose a New Integration): Propose a brand-new integration that Cognee doesn't support yet by opening a new GitHub issue (up to 5 issues max).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Note: Alongside each PR, contributors must publish a short blog post (Substack, Dev.to, Medium, etc.) explaining how the integration works in the real world.</p>\n<p><strong>Prizes &amp; Rewards (Total Prize Pool: $5,000+)</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Top Contributor Prize ($2,000): Choice of an iPhone Duo, MacBook Pro, or $2,000 in cash awarded to the person with the most merged contributions.</li>\n<li>Merged PR Lucky Draw ($100 &times; 20): $100 cash prize awarded to 20 randomly selected individuals from everyone who successfully submits a merged PR.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How to Participate</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pick an Issue: Browse open integration issues on the Cognee repo, comment with your approach, and get assigned by <code>@NMZivkovic</code> before starting.</li>\n<li>Build &amp; Open PR: Follow the Cognee integration guidelines and open your Pull Request during October.</li>\n<li>Write a Blog Post: Share a guide or real-world use case for your integration.</li>\n<li>Submit: Fill out the submission form on WeMakeDevs with your PR and blog post links (up to 5 active PRs allowed at a time).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Official Links &amp; Resources</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Support &amp; Community: Join the official Cognee Discord for technical guidance and mentor support.</li>\n</ul>",
