      "registrationStatus": "open",
      "description": "<div><strong>WEB FORGE AI &ndash; HACKATHON:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Build Smart. Create Real. Innovate with AI.</li>\n<li>Ready to test your AI + Web Development skills? Join us for an exciting challenge where innovation meets problem-solving!</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>Round-wise Details:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Round 1 &ndash; Online Quiz (FREE):</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Schedule:</strong> 5 days before the event.</li>\n<li><strong>Topics:</strong> AI, ML &amp; Web Development.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Round 2 &ndash; Offline Hackathon:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Date:</strong> 24th October.</li>\n<li><strong>Details:</strong> Build an AI + Web solution based on a surprise problem statement revealed on the spot! Be ready for unexpected challenges and exciting twists.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>Event Details:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Team Size:</strong> 2&ndash;3 Members.</li>\n<li><strong>Prizes:</strong> Up to ₹8,000.</li>\n<li><strong>Registration Fee:</strong> ₹200 (2 members) | ₹300 (3 members) (For Round 2).</li>\n<li><strong>Participation Certificates:</strong> As per event guidelines.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>Important Guidelines:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The quiz is scheduled 5 days before the main event; registered participants must follow the communicated instructions.</li>\n<li>The problem statement and hackathon rules will be announced by the organizers at the venue.</li>\n<li>Teams must follow the given timeline, submission format, and evaluation criteria.</li>\n<li>Organizers reserve the right to make reasonable changes to the schedule or format, with prior communication wherever possible.</li>\n<li>Decisions made by the judges regarding evaluation and results will be final.</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>Final Note:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Think. Code. Build. Compete.</li>\n<li>Bring your team, embrace the surprise, and turn your ideas into reality!</li>\n<li>Limited slots available &mdash; register now!</li>\n<li>WEB FORGE AI | CODE &bull; BUILD &bull; INNOVATE</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
