      "registrationStatus": "open",
      "description": "<p><strong>How to take part (two steps):</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Register here on Unstop. This is step one.</li>\n<li>Complete your registration at <a href=\"https://hackathon.homingo.co.in/?utm_source=unstop&amp;utm_medium=listing&amp;utm_campaign=hackdays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://hackathon.homingo.co.in/?utm_source=unstop&amp;utm_medium=listing&amp;utm_campaign=hackdays</a>. Your dashboard, your team and your project submission are on that site, so registering on Unstop alone is not enough to take part.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Homingo Hack Days is an online AI hackathon, open to participants across India. Entry is free. The idea is simple: ship something that works. You get two weeks to take a project from idea to a public repository and a short demo video.</p>\n<p><strong>Who can join:</strong> anyone in India. Take part solo or in a team of 2-4.</p>\n<p><strong>Tracks:</strong> Agents, Automation, LLM apps. AI tools are allowed, so use the stack you would use on a real project.</p>\n<p><strong>Timeline</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Registration closes: 15 Nov 2026, 11:59 PM IST</li>\n<li>Build phase: 21 Nov - 6 Dec 2026</li>\n<li>Submission deadline: 6 Dec 2026, 11:59 PM IST</li>\n<li>What to submit: a public GitHub repository and a short demo video (a live link is optional)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Prizes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rs 5,000 to the winner</li>\n<li>Recommendation certificates for the top 3</li>\n<li>A certificate for everyone who submits</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The whole event runs online.</p>\n<p><strong>Organiser:</strong> Homingo</p>\n<p>Questions: official@homingo.co.in</p>",
