      "registrationClosesAt": "2026-10-25T00:00:00+05:30",
      "registrationStatus": "open",
      "description": "<p>EDXcellence invites students across India to participate in the National Online Hackathon 2026, a free online coding and innovation challenge designed to encourage technical skills, creativity, teamwork, and real-world problem-solving.</p>\n<p><strong>Hackathon Tracks</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>\n<li>Data Science and Analytics</li>\n<li>Full-Stack Web Development</li>\n<li>Cybersecurity and Ethical Hacking</li>\n<li>Internet of Things (IoT) and Robotics</li>\n<li>Open Innovation and Technology Solutions</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Open to undergraduate and postgraduate students across India.</li>\n<li>Students from B.Tech, B.E., BCA, MCA, B.Sc., and other relevant disciplines are welcome.</li>\n<li>Beginners and experienced developers can participate.</li>\n<li>Participants may register individually or in teams of 2&ndash;4 members.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Registration Fee:</strong> Completely FREE.</p>\n<p><strong>Format:</strong> Online, pan-India participation.</p>\n<p><strong>Participation Process</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Complete the official registration process.</li>\n<li>Select a hackathon track and identify a problem to solve.</li>\n<li>Develop an original project or working prototype.</li>\n<li>Submit the project within the announced deadline.</li>\n<li>Eligible submissions will be evaluated based on innovation, technical implementation, problem-solving, usability, and presentation.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules and Guidelines</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Participants must provide accurate registration details.</li>\n<li>Projects must be original, and third-party resources must be appropriately credited.</li>\n<li>Plagiarism, fraudulent participation, and copied work presented as original may lead to disqualification.</li>\n<li>Participants must follow applicable laws, software licences, and ethical development practices.</li>\n<li>Project submission instructions, deadlines, and final event guidelines will be communicated by the organisers.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Perks and Benefits</strong></p>\n<p><strong>For Winners</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Free access to the EdXcellence Premium Internship Program worth ₹9,999.</li>\n<li>Free access to the Vedic Intelligence Program, including lifetime mentorship.</li>\n<li>Certificates recognising achievements.</li>\n<li>Letter of Recommendation (LOR), subject to the organiser's eligibility and verification criteria.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>For All Participants</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Free access to the EdXcellence Internship Training Program worth ₹2,999.</li>\n<li>Free access to the Vedic Intelligence Program, including lifetime mentorship.</li>\n<li>Certificate of Participation for eligible participants who participate in the hackathon.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Exclusive Discount</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>A 90% discount coupon code for eligible EdXcellence programs will be provided to participants, subject to applicable terms and validity.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Important Conditions</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Registration and participation are free; no payment is required to enter the hackathon.</li>\n<li>Complimentary programs and mentorship are subject to the scope and terms communicated by EdXcellence LLP.</li>\n<li>Winners will be determined through the official evaluation process.</li>\n<li>Participation does not guarantee employment, a paid internship, or a stipend.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Organiser:</strong> EdXcellence LLP<br /><br /><strong>Website:</strong> <a href=\"https://edxcellence.org.in/\" data-rich-text-autolink=\"\">https://edxcellence.org.in/</a><br /><br /><strong>Date:&nbsp; November 1st week onwards as per participants the date will be announced in the month.</strong></p>\n<p>Register for FREE and turn your innovative ideas into impactful technology solutions.</p>",
      "eligibility": "{\"sector\":[\"students\"],\"engineering\":[{\"course\":\"btech\",\"type\":\"engineering\",\"programme\":[\"all\"],\"passoutYear\":[\"all\"],\"specialization\":[\"all\"],\"duration\":4},{\"course\":\"bca\",\"type\":\"engineering\",\"programme\":[\"all\"],\"passoutYear\":[\"all\"],\"specialization\":[\"all\"],\"duration\":3},{\"course\":\"mca\",\"type\":\"engineering\",\"programme\":[\"all\"],\"passoutYear\":[\"all\"],\"specialization\":[\"all\"],\"duration\":2},{\"course\":\"mca1\",\"type\":\"engineering\",\"programme\":[\"all\"],\"passoutYear\":[\"all\"],\"specialization\":[\"all\"],\"duration\":3}],\"bSchools\":[],\"arts\":[{\"course\":\"bsc\",\"type\":\"arts\",\"programme\":[\"all\"],\"passoutYear\":[\"all\"],\"specialization\":[\"all\"],\"duration\":3}],\"medicine\":[],\"law\":[],\"others\":[\"all\"],\"experience\":[\"all\"],\"studentPassoutYearsSelected\":[\"all\"],\"fresherPassoutYearsSelected\":[\"all\"],\"schoolFilteredClasses\":[\"all\"],\"minMarks\":{\"high_school_perc\":0,\"high_school_cgpa\":0},\"locations\":[],\"location_type\":\"all\",\"professionalEligibility\":null,\"fresherEligibility\":null}",
