      "description": "<h1>CognitionNext '26</h1>\n<p><strong>CognitionNext '26</strong> is a two-round hackathon organized by <a href=\"https://cognext.ai/\"><strong>Cognext.ai</strong></a> <strong>in collaboration with Technovanza, VJTI</strong>, designed to bring together students passionate about <strong>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</strong>.</p>\n<p>Participants will get an opportunity to showcase their AI expertise, build innovative solutions, compete for a <strong>₹1,00,000 prize pool</strong>, and potentially earn internship opportunities with Cognext AI.</p>\n<h2>Eligibility</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Open to students form <strong>all Engineering Colleges</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Teams can consist of <strong>1&ndash;2 participants</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Each participant can register with only one team.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Participants must complete Round 1 to qualify for Round 2.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Hackathon Theme</h2>\n<p><strong>Artificial Intelligence&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>Participants are encouraged to demonstrate their knowledge, projects, technical skills, and innovative applications of AI/ML.</p>\n<h1>Event Structure</h1>\n<h2>Round 1 &ndash; Online Screening Round</h2>\n<p><strong>Dates:</strong> 18th October 2026 &ndash; 21st October 2026<br /><strong>Mode:</strong> Online</p>\n<p>Round 1 will be a screening round based on participants' <strong>work, achievements, and contributions in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</strong>.</p>\n<p>Participants will be required to submit:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>A summary highlighting their significant work, achievements, and contributions in AI/ML.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Their <strong>GitHub profile link</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Links to relevant projects, repositories, deployed applications, research work, or other proof of work.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Participants are strongly encouraged to provide <strong>project links, GitHub repositories, or other relevant evidence</strong> supporting their submissions.</p>\n<p>The number of teams shortlisted for Round 2 will be announced by the organizers.</p>\n<h2>Round 2 &ndash; Offline Hackathon</h2>\n<p><strong>Dates:</strong> 23rd October 2026 &ndash; 24th October 2026<br /><strong>Mode:</strong> Offline<br /><strong>Venue:</strong> Veermata Jijabai Technological Institute (VJTI), Mumbai<br /><strong>Duration:</strong> 12 hours</p>\n<p>Shortlisted teams will participate in the offline hackathon and work on a problem statement based on <strong>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</strong>.</p>\n<p>The <strong>problem statement, submission requirements, judging criteria, and weightages</strong> for Round 2 will be released by the organizers.</p>\n<p>Participants will be required to develop and submit their solution within the specified deadline.</p>\n<h1>Prizes &amp; Opportunities</h1>\n<h3>Total Prize Pool worth: ₹1,00,000</h3>\n<p>Participants can compete for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Prize Pool</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Potential internship opportunities with <strong>Cognext AI</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Certificates</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Opportunity to showcase AI skills and projects</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Internship details:</strong> To be announced by the organizers.</p>\n<h1>Rules &amp; Guidelines</h1>\n<ol start=\"1\">\n<li>\n<p>Teams may consist of <strong>1&ndash;2 participants</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Each participant can register with only one team.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Participants must complete Round 1 to qualify for Round 2.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Round 1 submissions must include the required AI/ML work summary and GitHub profile.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Round 2 teams must submit their final solution within the specified deadline.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Plagiarism or submission of another participant's work may lead to disqualification.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Participants must follow all instructions issued by the organizing team.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>AI tools are allowed</strong> in the Round 2, as per the guidelines provided by the organizers.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Rules regarding the use of AI tools, APIs, open-source code, and previously developed work will be communicated by the organizers.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The decision of the organizing and judging team will be final.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h1>Registration Details</h1>\n<p><strong>Registration Fee:</strong> Free</p>\n<p><strong>Registration Window:</strong> till 21st October 2026</p>\n<p><strong>Participant Limit:</strong> 1&ndash;2 members per team</p>\n<p><strong>Round 1:</strong> 18th October 2026 &ndash; 21st October 2026</p>\n<p><strong>Round 2:</strong> 23rd October 2026 &ndash; 24th October 2026</p>\n<h1>Important Dates</h1>\n<table style=\"width: 53.775%; height: 109px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<th style=\"width: 26.7633%; height: 18px;\">Event</th>\n<th style=\"width: 71.3918%; height: 18px;\">Date</th>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 37px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 26.7633%; height: 37px;\">Registration</td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.3918%; height: 37px;\">till 21st Oct 2026</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 26.7633%; height: 18px;\">Round 1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.3918%; height: 18px;\">18th Oct 2026 &ndash; 21st Oct 2026</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 26.7633%; height: 18px;\">Round 2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.3918%; height: 18px;\">23rd Oct &ndash; 24th Oct 2026</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 26.7633%; height: 18px;\">Prize Pool</td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.3918%; height: 18px;\">₹1,00,000</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Judging criteria and detailed Round 2 submission requirements will be released along with the problem statement.</strong></p>\n<h1>Why Participate?</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Showcase your <strong>AI/ML projects and technical achievements</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Compete in a <strong>12-hour offline hackathon</strong> at VJTI.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Win from a <strong>₹1,00,000 prize pool</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Get an opportunity to connect with <strong>Cognext AI</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Explore potential <strong>internship opportunities</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Earn certificates and gain valuable hackathon experience.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
      "eligibility": "{\"sector\":[\"students\"],\"engineering\":[{\"course\":\"btech\",\"type\":\"engineering\",\"programme\":[\"all\"],\"passoutYear\":[\"all\"],\"specialization\":[\"all\"],\"duration\":4}],\"bSchools\":[],\"arts\":[],\"medicine\":[],\"law\":[],\"others\":[\"all\"],\"experience\":[\"all\"],\"studentPassoutYearsSelected\":[\"all\"],\"fresherPassoutYearsSelected\":[\"all\"],\"schoolFilteredClasses\":[\"all\"],\"minMarks\":{\"high_school_perc\":0,\"high_school_cgpa\":0},\"locations\":[],\"location_type\":\"all\",\"professionalEligibility\":null,\"fresherEligibility\":null}",
